@startuml cls-academic
title Diagrama de clases — Académico

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle

class Person <<externo — identity>> {
}

enum EnrollmentStatus <<enumeración>> {
  Active
  Withdrawn
  Completed
}

class School {
  +schoolId: Int
  +code: String
  +name: String
  +cityId: String
  +address: String
  +phone: String
  +email: String
  +status: Boolean
}

class Program {
  +programId: Int
  +schoolId: Int
  +code: String
  +name: String
  +status: Boolean
}

class AcademicPeriod {
  +academicPeriodId: Int
  +schoolId: Int
  +name: String
  +startsOn: Date
  +endsOn: Date
  +isActive: Boolean
}

class Cohort {
  +cohortId: Long
  +programId: Int
  +academicPeriodId: Int
  +code: String
  +status: Boolean
  +register()
  +activate()
  +finish()
}

class Course {
  +courseId: Int
  +programId: Int
  +code: String
  +name: String
  +creditHours: Int
  +status: Boolean
}

class AcademicActorType {
  +actorTypeId: Int
  +code: String
  +name: String
}

class AcademicActor {
  +academicActorId: Long
  +personId: UUID
  +actorTypeId: Int
  +schoolId: Int
  +actorCode: String
  +startedOn: Date
  +endedOn: Date
  +status: Boolean
}

class Enrollment {
  +enrollmentId: Long
  +academicActorId: Long
  +cohortId: Long
  +enrolledOn: Date
  +enrollmentStatus: EnrollmentStatus
  +enroll()
  +withdraw()
  +complete()
}

School "1" -- "0..*" Program : program.school_id FK
School "1" -- "0..*" AcademicPeriod : academic_period.school_id FK
Program "1" -- "0..*" Cohort : cohort.program_id FK
AcademicPeriod "1" -- "0..*" Cohort : cohort.academic_period_id FK
Program "1" -- "0..*" Course : course.program_id FK
AcademicActorType "1" -- "0..*" AcademicActor : academic_actor.actor_type_id FK
School "1" -- "0..*" AcademicActor : academic_actor.school_id FK
AcademicActor "1" -- "0..*" Enrollment : enrollment.academic_actor_id FK
Cohort "1" -- "0..*" Enrollment : enrollment.cohort_id FK
Enrollment --> EnrollmentStatus

AcademicActor ..> Person : person_id\n(trans-contexto, sin FK)

note right of School
  RN-11: todos los datos académicos pertenecen a
  una School (raíz multi-sede). city_id proviene
  del catálogo externo countriesnow.space, sin FK —
  identity.city está en desuso.
end note

note right of Program
  RN-12: un Program solo puede agregarse si aún
  no existe en la misma School
  (uq_program_code_school).
end note

note left of Cohort
  RN-14: debe tener un instructor válido antes
  de que comience el registro de asistencia — se
  garantiza mediante un ScheduleBlock del contexto
  Scheduling (ver cls-scheduling.puml), no dibujado
  aquí. code es globalmente único.
end note

note right of AcademicActor
  Representación unificada de Student/Instructor.
  RN-16: debe referenciar una Person válida.
  uq_actor_person_type_school evita
  duplicados.
end note

note bottom of Enrollment
  uq_enrollment_actor_cohort: una inscripción
  (enrollment) por actor por cohorte (cohort).
end note

note as N1
  Todas las clases también llevan el bloque estándar
  de auditoría (created_at/updated_at/deleted_at/
  created_by/updated_by/deleted_by/row_version) —
  omitido aquí por legibilidad. Ver AGENTS.md §2.2 y
  06-data/domains/03-academic.md para la
  vista ER a nivel de columnas.
end note

@enduml
